# recursive interpolation not allowed

Ijade kọ: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Eto ẹya-ara: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), ila-tuntun.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Ijade kọ: a, ila-tuntun.


Eto ẹya-ara: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] mu-ṣiṣẹ: Otitọ.

